<div class="card green"><h2>📋 MODULE 1: LOGIN + PERMISSIONS (20 min)</h2><h3>Objective: Understand ranks + At Least 1 Subject + Login</h3><p><span class="step">1</span><b>Theory (5 min):</b> Show permissions matrix:</p><div class="badge">ADMIN = ALL + ALL 3 MANUALS + ADD+REMOVE - ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN Add+Remove | EDUCATOR/HOD Add Only<br>PRINCIPAL = Dashboard + ADD+REMOVE Books+Learners - Issue any subject<br>LIBRARIAN = ADD+REMOVE Books+Learners - Issue any subject - START LIVE DB<br>HOD = ADD Learners Only - Cannot remove - Issue only their subject - At Least 1 Subject check<br>EDUCATOR = ADD Learners Only - Cannot remove - Issue only their subject - At Least 1 Subject check<br>PARENT/LEARNER = View Only - L-0001<br>Return = ALL can return ANY book - Retrieve ANY subject</div><p><span class="step">2</span><b>Demo (5 min):</b> Trainer logs in as ADMIN admin@makhanani.com / admin123 - WORDSWORTH 700310854 - Show header 👑 FOUNDER + 🎓 TRAINING buttons appear only for ADMIN - Explain applyPermissions()</p><p><span class="step">3</span><b>Hands-on (10 min):</b> Each trainee:</p><div class="badge"><span class="check"></span>Open incognito https://vusichauke3037-glitch.github.io/MAKHANANI-LIBRARY/ - Should show ☁️ ✅ CONNECTED V5.0 PRODUCTION NEW PROJECT 93e52 within 2 sec - If Local Mode, click SYNC NOW - FORCES ALERT<br><span class="check"></span>Select Rank: e.g. EDUCATOR - Search WORDSWORTH or 700310854 - Select<br><span class="check"></span>Enter staff email e.g. math@wordsworth.co.za - Password - If not added yet, trainer adds in MANAGE tab first - At Least 1 Subject required e.g. MATH<br><span class="check"></span>Click LOGIN - Check welcome text shows rank + subjects + permission e.g. ADD Learners Only - EDUCATOR/HOD: Add Only</div></div>

<div class="card blue"><h2>👥 MODULE 2: LEARNERS - AUTO L-0001 (20 min)</h2><h3>Objective: Master Auto L-0001 + Block duplicate per school</h3><p><span class="step">1</span><b>Theory (5 min):</b> Explain L-0001 auto:</p><div class="badge"><b>How it works:</b><br>learnerCounter stored in localStorage + Firestore makhanani/main.learnerCounter<br>When empty ID, system generates L- + String(learnerCounter).padStart(4,'0') e.g. L-0001<br>Checks duplicate per school: If L-0001 exists in 700310854, auto increments to L-0002 - Blocks duplicate!<br>learnerCounter++ after add - Save to localStorage + syncToCloud(true) → Triggers LIVE DB update!<br>Works offline - EnablePersistence caches<br>Top preview: Next Auto ID: L-0001 | Total in this school: X | Total all: Y</div><p><span class="step">2</span><b>Demo (5 min):</b> Trainer goes to 👥 LEARNERS tab - Shows Next Auto ID: L-0001 - Enters Name John Doe - Grade G10 - Class 10A - Leaves ID empty - Clicks 🔢 AUTO ID - Shows L-0001 generated - Clicks ADD LEARNER - Alert ✅ Learner Added! ID: L-0001 - Shows barcode with school header EMIS + Town + Province + MAKHANANI V5.0 + ✅ CONNECTED + REAL-TIME DB LIVE + OFFLINE + APP PWA</p><p><span class="step">3</span><b>Hands-on (10 min):</b> Each trainee:</p><div class="badge"><span class="check"></span>Go to 👥 LEARNERS tab - Check Next Auto ID preview<br><span class="check"></span>Add 3 learners: e.g. Learner A G10 10A (empty ID = L-0001), Learner B G10 10B (empty ID = L-0002), Learner C G11 11A with manual ID L-0005<br><span class="check"></span>Try to add duplicate L-0001 again in same school - Should block: ❌ BLOCKED - ID DUPLICATE per school! - V5.0 PRODUCTION<br><span class="check"></span>Check learner list shows barcodes - JsBarcode CODE128 - Print test<br><span class="check"></span>Check permissions: If EDUCATOR/HOD, can add but cannot see ❌ REMOVE LEARNER button - Only ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN see REMOVE - Check applyPermissions()</div></div>

<div class="card yellow"><h2>📚 MODULE 3: BOOKS - ACC-G10-001 + Qty (20 min)</h2><h3>Objective: Master ACC-G10-001 + Qty 5 = 001-005 + ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN only</h3><p><span class="step">1</span><b>Theory (5 min):</b> Explain ACC-G10-001:</p><div class="badge"><b>How it works:</b><br>Subject-Grade-Number e.g. ACC-G10-001 = Accounting Grade 10 Book 001<br>bookCounter stored in localStorage + Firestore makhanani/main.bookCounter<br>Qty feature: If Qty=5 and Subject=ACC Grade=G10, creates ACC-G10-001, ACC-G10-002, ACC-G10-003, ACC-G10-004, ACC-G10-005 - bookCounter increments by 5<br>Manual code: Can override e.g. enter ACC-G10-001 manually<br>Permissions: canAddRemoveBooks() = ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN only - EDUCATOR/HOD see 🔒 Only ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN can ADD/REMOVE BOOKS - Your Rank: EDUCATOR<br>Works offline + Sync triggers LIVE DB</div><p><span class="step">2</span><b>Demo (5 min):</b> Trainer logs in as ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN - Goes to 📚 BOOKS tab - Shows ADD BOOK button enabled - Enters Title Accounting Grade 10 - Subject ACC - Grade G10 - Teacher Mr Nkosi - Qty 5 - Leaves Manual empty - Clicks ADD BOOK - Alert ✅ BOOKS ADDED! Qty:5 First: ACC-G10-001 - Shows 5 barcode cards with school header + ACC-G10-001 etc</p><p><span class="step">3</span><b>Hands-on (10 min):</b> Each trainee:</p><div class="badge"><span class="check"></span>Login as EDUCATOR - Go to 📚 BOOKS tab - Should see 🔒 Only ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN can ADD/REMOVE BOOKS - Your Rank: EDUCATOR - Button disabled opacity 0.4 - Cannot add - This is correct!<br><span class="check"></span>Login as ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN - Go to 📚 BOOKS - Button enabled: ➕ ADD BOOK(S) - ACC-G10-001<br><span class="check"></span>Add books: Title MATH G10 - Subject MATH - Grade G10 - Qty 3 - Empty manual = MATH-G10-001, 002, 003<br><span class="check"></span>Add with manual code: Title ENHL G11 - Subject ENHL - Grade G11 - Manual ENHL-G11-001 - Qty ignored when manual used<br><span class="check"></span>Try remove book: Click ❌ REMOVE BOOK - Only ADMIN/PRINCIPAL/LIBRARIAN can - If book BORROWED, cannot remove - Return first - Check issues array<br><span class="check"></span>Check book list barcodes + school header EMIS + Town + Province</div></div>

<div class="card"><h2>📤📥 MODULE 4: ISSUE + RETURN - At Least 1 Subject + Retrieve ANY (20 min)</h2><h3>Objective: Master Issue with Subject check + Return ANY</h3><p><span class="step">1</span><b>Theory (5 min):</b> Explain Issue logic:</p><div class="badge"><b>Issue - At Least 1 Subject check:</b><br>Staff must have at least 1 subject in staff array - e.g. MATH, ACC, ENHL - Check in firebaseLogin() - At Least 1 Subject required<br>EDUCATOR/HOD/PRINCIPAL: System checks if your subject matches book subject - e.g. You are MATH teacher with subjects [MATH, MATHL], you try to issue ACC-G10-001 (subject ACC) - Alert ❌ SUBJECT RESTRICTION! Your Subjects: MATH, MATHL Book: ACC Allowed: MATH, MATHL Only but retrieve any<br>Librarian/ADMIN: Can issue any subject<br>Return: ANY staff can return ANY book - Retrieve ANY subject - Intentional - No subject check on return<br>Issues array: {learner:L-0001, book:ACC-G10-001, status:BORROWED/RETURNED, date, school, issuedBy, returnedBy, returnDate}</div><p><span class="step">2</span><b>Demo (5 min):</b> Trainer as EDUCATOR with MATH subject - Goes to 📤 ISSUE tab - Types L-0001 - Search shows L-0001 John Doe - Types ACC-G10-001 - Search shows ACC-G10-001 Accounting - Clicks ISSUE - Alert ❌ SUBJECT RESTRICTION! - Because MATH ≠ ACC - Then types MATH-G10-001 - Clicks ISSUE - Success ✅ Issued! - Goes to 📥 RETURN tab - Types ACC-G10-001 (even though not MATH) - Clicks RETURN - Success - Retrieve ANY works!</p><p><span class="step">3</span><b>Hands-on (10 min):</b> Each trainee:</p><div class="badge"><span class="check"></span>Login as EDUCATOR MATH - Try issue ACC-G10-001 → Should block SUBJECT RESTRICTION<br><span class="check"></span>Issue MATH-G10-001 to L-0001 → Should succeed - Check issueStatus ✅ Issued + HOME LIVE DB Borrowed +1<br><span class="check"></span>Login as LIBRARIAN - Issue ACC-G10-001 to L-0002 → Should succeed - Any subject allowed for LIBRARIAN<br><span class="check"></span>Go to 📥 RETURN - Return ACC-G10-001 → Should succeed even if you are MATH teacher - Retrieve ANY<br><span class="check"></span>Check HOME LIVE DB tab - Borrowed count should update - Live transactions list - Last 20</div></div>

