TIME DB onSnapshot active + OFFLINE - Time - LIVE UPDATES WITHOUT REFRESH!<br><span class="check"></span>Check 4 counters - Borrowed LIVE DB, Returned LIVE DB, Books LIVE DB, Learners LIVE DB - Should show numbers + Updated time<br><span class="check"></span>Go to ⚙️ MANAGE SYNC DB tab - Top should show ☁️ ✅ CONNECTED - V5.0 PRODUCTION - NEW PROJECT 93e52 - REAL-TIME DATABASE LIVE + OFFLINE READY - Exists:true - If Local Mode, click SYNC NOW<br><span class="check"></span>Click ☁️ SYNC TO CLOUD - Should show alert ✅✅✅ SYNCED V5.0 PRODUCTION NEW PROJECT 93e52! SUCCESS! Schools:X Books:Y Learners:Z - Firestore write OK! + REAL-TIME DB LIVE Update Sent!<br><span class="check"></span>Click 🧪 TEST FIREBASE DIRECT - Should show ✅✅✅ SUCCESS V5.0 PRODUCTION NEW PROJECT 93e52! CONNECTED! Firestore responded! Doc exists:true Project: makhanani-library-93e52<br><span class="check"></span>Click 🖨️ PRINT LIVE REPORT - Should open print window with Live report - Borrowed, Returned, Books, Learners - Project info<br><span class="check"></span>Test offline: Turn off WiFi - Add learner L-0006 offline - Should work - localStorage - Turn on WiFi - Click SYNC NOW - Should sync + trigger LIVE DB for all</div></div>

